        "Exact osteopontin values and replicate counts are not supplied in the visible observations.",
        "Only one standardized P. gingivalis LPS preparation was studied."
      ],
      "rationale": "The marker staining directly compares both LPS sources for osteopontin, while the mineralization observation compares E. coli LPS only with untreated controls. Keeping these endpoints distinct preserves the supported source-specific conclusion without implying an unperformed species comparison for mineralization."
