      "basis_ids": [
        "o11",
        "o16",
        "o19"
      ],
      "rationale": "This alternative accounts for the reported absence of LD NiO peaks without equating non-detection by laboratory XRD with complete chemical reduction. It is consistent with residual nanoscale NiO imaged after LH to 700 °C and with the reported partial retention of NiO in LD XPS at 700 °C. The differing measurement scopes and heating-mode details prevent treating those observations as proof of residual NiO in the specific XRD specimen.",
      "content": {
