      "limitations": [
        "The coating is parameterized by Rf,sp and Cf, not by chitosan chemistry or a measured chitosan coating.",
        "The thresholds are model outputs; the packet reports no measured ZRA data validating them.",
        "The approximately 2% result is reported for a specific area and coating resistance, while the broader 2–4% statement applies to high-resistance coatings.",
        "The supplied observations report no confidence intervals for these thresholds."
      ],
      "rationale": "Observations o09 and o12 give the high-resistance prediction and its approximately 2% example; o10 and o05 show that the prediction changes substantially at the baseline resistance. Node n10 already identifies the result as a model prediction, specifies its parameter-dependent scope, and disclaims a specific coating chemistry. Refining it to remove or alter that scope is therefore unnecessary."
