      "description": "The claim calls the stability result operational stability under ambient operation, whereas the long-duration ambient result is an unencapsulated storage test lasting 1700 h. The only visible illuminated operational-stability observation is a 150 s fixed-bias photocurrent hold.",
      "basis_ids": ["o16", "o20"]
    }
  ],
  "proposed_updates": [
