            "statement": "The champion SiC-APTES carbon-electrode p-i-n C-PSC reached a reverse-scan PCE of 18.43%. In a separate 150 s, 1-sun fixed-bias hold, steady-state photocurrent was stable for all devices, and the champion SiC-APTES device gave a stabilized PCE of 18.2%. In an unencapsulated ambient-storage test at 20–25 °C and 40–60% RH, after 1700 h the control retained 54% of its initial PCE, while SiC and SiC-APTES devices retained more than 90%.",
