        "Device-level outcomes and variability over a stated operational duration, with ambient conditions recorded."
      ],
      "comparison_or_control": "Compare devices made with control, SiC, and SiC-APTES carbon pastes under the same operational-aging protocol.",
      "why_informative": "Such measurements would directly test the operational-stability wording; the visible 150 s hold and 1700 h storage test address different conditions and durations.",
      "missing_design_information": [
        "Operational-aging illumination, electrical load or bias protocol, and duration.",
        "Encapsulation status, environmental conditions during operation, and device counts."
      ]
